questions.question:
Derive the expression to calculate the order of Butterworth approximation for given lowpass filter specifications. Calculate the order of Butterworth low pass filter having following specification;

i) Passband extends from $\omega = 0$ to $\omega = 200$ rad/s and the attenuation in the passband should not exceed 0.1 dB.
ii) Stopband extends from $\omega = 2000$ rad/s to $\omega = \infty$ and the attenuation in the stopband should not be less than 30 dB

